<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵδρ-ῡμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>establishment, foundation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰάσονος ἵ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					6.1.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποιῆσσαν χαρίτων ἵ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					3.1.73
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>temple, shrine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.144
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				339
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1036
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				951
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				717b
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>statue</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιμόνων ἵ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					811
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.22.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σὸν ἵ. πόλεως</span> the <i>stay,
				support</i> of thy city, of chieftains, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				631
			</span></i> (lyr.). [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵδρῠμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
				</span></i>
			 l.c. (s. v.l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> by
			nature, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1032
			</span></i>.]</div>
